{"data": [{"author_id": "1537214815663493121", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:28:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117760932827062644"], "id": "2117760932827062644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108650243365736855", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Was revisiting this lecture today, proactive agents are something that I'm really interested in. Started really thinking about it ~1.5 years ago, when I was doing growvy (https://t.co/lzqMzicFgV) and wanted this kind of always-on feeling that @bot, dots and many others are trying https://t.co/txFX5U6kEw", "url": "https://x.com/pontidev/status/2117760932827062644"}, {"author_id": "22042254", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:25:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117760073724490175"], "id": "2117760073724490175", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116999470437339364", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Most enterprise SaaS companies put distribution in phase two.\n\nGrok Bot made it phase one: shareable templates, just 17 days after beta.\n\n6 things I'd take from it:\n\n1) Ship distribution as fast as the product. The sharing layer wasn't an afterthought. It launched almost straight https://t.co/rN8nqxZ2JL", "url": "https://x.com/TheCoolestCool/status/2117760073724490175"}, {"author_id": "761475756", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:24:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117759907701178445"], "id": "2117759907701178445", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1332532440", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117752062285054071", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SJFriedl @eevblog Cursor is also excellent. It's unbeatable if you have existing codebases because it comes with a full IDE (VS Code fork), with agentic coding built in.\n\nYou also get Grok Bot, and Grok Build.\n\nHaving been coding for 45 years, I have hardly written any code by hand this year.", "url": "https://x.com/Stu_J_/status/2117759907701178445"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:24:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117759749173260487"], "id": "2117759749173260487", "in_reply_to_user_id": "636582088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117759600036569208", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@brandonhassler @BeardyBrandon @bot @elonmusk Yes. A small team drawn largely from Cursor built the first working version of Grok Bot from scratch in roughly one month during the SpaceXAI partnership period. Public beta launched Aug 11, three days before the acquisition closed on Aug 14. It still runs on Cursor\u2019s cloud and", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117759749173260487"}, {"author_id": "2105870874524196865", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:23:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117759643619647850"], "id": "2117759643619647850", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1941189448386977792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117758836572631175", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mdnlabs honestly its having everything in one place\n\nbring your own sub so my gpt and claude code plans run right in it, and when one becomes top dog i just switch models instead of bouncing between apps with different uis\n\nt3 connect links my phone laptop and desktop with tailscale and", "url": "https://x.com/sortofadev/status/2117759643619647850"}, {"author_id": "1796424939916165120", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:19:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117758541885010396"], "id": "2117758541885010396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We Built Grok Bot. Here Are Our 14 Best Bots | Peng Zheng &amp; Lauren Tan https://t.co/0xUqmuKLq5 via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/BennySong969852/status/2117758541885010396"}, {"article": {"title": "We Hit It Last Night"}, "author_id": "1935161029538791424", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:18:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117758455146512841"], "id": "2117758455146512841", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 180, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/T9AOGzu1ii", "url": "https://x.com/signaloftheeye/status/2117758455146512841"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:18:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117758445466124290"], "id": "2117758445466124290", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1592613961287061504", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117758421160145103", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SightRoll Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117758445466124290"}, {"article": {"title": "I Run My Company With 30+ AI Agents. Here's the Exact Org Chart, the Rules, and What Broke."}, "author_id": "23894714", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:18:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117758330156253649"], "id": "2117758330156253649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How to run an agentic consulting business https://t.co/9q0os4nLKJ", "url": "https://x.com/AbhijitVerekar/status/2117758330156253649"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117757691909255168"]}, "author_id": "2269676263", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:15:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117757713761575194"], "id": "2117757713761575194", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "grok bot can shop for you now\n\nit finds the best deal, compares items, and tracks every order\n\ni already run a bot that watches my inbox for shipping emails. now it's just built in! \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f \n\nwhat are you having it buy first? https://t.co/srVLUdGRQp", "url": "https://x.com/thecsguy/status/2117757713761575194"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117743757973925888"]}, "author_id": "1674918543891021826", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:14:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117757246738427911"], "id": "2117757246738427911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117732251760996831", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot: from your first bot to a working team in 57 minutes.\n\nOne recurring job. Clear owners. A result you can open and check.\n\nThat\u2019s a useful target for your first AI team.\n\nThis walkthrough covers bot setup, team workflows, reusable templates and working from your phone. https://t.co/N5eKNRkfnp https://t.co/GE2HG6KjcS", "url": "https://x.com/sorryimgeek/status/2117757246738427911"}, {"author_id": "2065171490664747008", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:12:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117756937903436082"], "id": "2117756937903436082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I built this with Grok \u2014 try it out: https://t.co/dU56GJdum7\n@grok @bot", "url": "https://x.com/Carlihasfaith/status/2117756937903436082"}, {"article": {"title": "\u6d77\u5916\u306e\u5929\u624d\u304c\u5148\u306b\u898b\u629c\u3044\u3066\u3044\u305f\uff5cdots\u30fbGrok Bot\u30fbMuse\u306e\u9078\u3073\u65b9"}, "author_id": "1908107969520406528", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:11:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117756643744330016"], "id": "2117756643744330016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 307, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/18LsdosxjP", "url": "https://x.com/Sou_AIDriven/status/2117756643744330016"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:10:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117756220832432131"], "id": "2117756220832432131", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2857151946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117756085771849895", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SI5NAL @AndrewWarner 1. In Grok Bot open Plugins (or Connect Apps), search Zapier, add the plugin.\n2. Sign in to Zapier and approve access.\n3. Tell Grok to run the onboarding skill or /zapier-setup so it sees your apps.\n4. Describe any repetitive routine: \u201cTurn this into a Zap that does X when Y", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117756220832432131"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117755566072459265"]}, "author_id": "2082183548849496064", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:09:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117755995745292625"], "id": "2117755995745292625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117688711685218632", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "the bot made $3,418.73 from $260 while i slept\n\nhere's what it did\n\nput in $260 at 6:38pm\n\nfound 2 wallets from the 24h leaderboard\n&gt; first one +$29,570 in 24h\n&gt; second one +$29,741 in 24h\n\nsent Grok Bot one message\n&gt; copy every buy 30s after them\n&gt; sell when they sell\n&gt; take https://t.co/8ncRX4wsEy https://t.co/ZAWBeJ396q", "url": "https://x.com/agentslopzone/status/2117755995745292625"}, {"author_id": "1133493145671364608", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:07:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117755685723373929"], "id": "2117755685723373929", "in_reply_to_user_id": "977319498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117683262168441088", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BeardyBrandon @bot @elonmusk Grokbot was not built by Elon at any step of the process", "url": "https://x.com/bucky_MT/status/2117755685723373929"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117754985282744320"]}, "author_id": "1324183584282939392", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:05:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117755005306278108"], "id": "2117755005306278108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 470, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I wanted Grok Bot to set my Tesla navigation based on my schedule. There's still no official Tesla app connection. Guess what? I figured it out again \ud83d\ude09 Grok Bot can now get my Tesla navigation ready.\n\nHere's the workflow:\n\nI asked Grok Bot to book a dentist appointment. It https://t.co/OXiuCbBLJr", "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2117755005306278108"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:04:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754908539510890"], "id": "2117754908539510890", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1437372303659225091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117754746366775743", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@inmuskwebelieve @elonmusk @bot Grok Bot is designed to sit on hold through long queues and menus so you don't have to. Native outbound calling is currently limited to eligible US accounts and US numbers, with broader international support (including the UK) still on the roadmap. Third-party connectors can", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117754908539510890"}, {"author_id": "2096398346512429057", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:04:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754701064388912"], "id": "2117754701064388912", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117395370351140883", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A web clock that follows the daylight, sun to moon, built with a Grok Bot crew.\n\nCory turned it into a video and shared a live try link. Huge congrats! https://t.co/TjMGpA4Fo0", "url": "https://x.com/botpagesco/status/2117754701064388912"}, {"author_id": "1386253275121455105", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:03:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754550836764963"], "id": "2117754550836764963", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4862961741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117695266266493325", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@LikeToasters Lol\nI set up a grokbot then I set up another one. And mine are working everyday, but I haven't really seen my usage change. \nI've been reading about people running out of usage though. I wonder what the difference is?", "url": "https://x.com/GillelandKristi/status/2117754550836764963"}, {"author_id": "1474048539131093008", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:02:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754364903178517"], "id": "2117754364903178517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Built a free Grok Bot for dirt guys: Dirt Bot \ud83d\ude9c\n\nBid build-ups, cut/fill and shrink math, pipe checks, scope letters.\n\nDrop in a stamped plan set or CAD. Get every quantity by source sheet, cut/fill balance and Excel bid sheet.\n\nFirst takeoff free \ud83d\udc47\nhttps://t.co/JOWfTLA7hC", "url": "https://x.com/natejtom/status/2117754364903178517"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117754129946718208"]}, "author_id": "2852316037", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:02:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117754355390504993"], "id": "2117754355390504993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 241, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HOLY SH*T. MY GROK BOT TRADING SETUP JUST FINISHED ONE PAPER SESSION AT +$4,357.31\n\nI gave it $32.69 in paper money. it finished at $4,390. 134x in one session. 36 simulated trades, with entries, position sizes, and exits recorded automatically\n\n9 GitHub repos to build your own https://t.co/9sKeamJF19", "url": "https://x.com/Greshamtrade/status/2117754355390504993"}, {"author_id": "2026388309224611840", "created_at": "2026-11-03T23:00:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117753792846311640"], "id": "2117753792846311640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GROK BOT SPOTLIGHT \u2014 SPAM-CALL SCRUBBER\n\nYour phone number is for sale right now \u2014 sitting on people-search sites and data-broker lists you never signed up for. That's why the spam calls never stop.\n\nSpam-Call Scrubber is a free Grok Bot built by Arash that hunts those listings", "url": "https://x.com/CoachFerg25/status/2117753792846311640"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117751928507809792"]}, "author_id": "729157082", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:55:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117752463797477474"], "id": "2117752463797477474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "293 reques